      "snippet": {
        "line": 385,
        "text": "chartStress h N σ U := fun i => ChartScales.Q (U.1 + N) ^ (2 * velocityExponent h) * σ i / physicalViscosity h N U  — the argument R of `increment`, i.e. the paper's Σ/ε, with the extra physical-to-chart factor Q^{2A}"
